  "releaseNotes": "A failed AssertStatusCode now shows the response body (cut at 1,000 characters), or why there was no response; with Concurrently, each response that differed explains itself. The XUnitAssured.Http README and the XML doc examples teach ExecuteAsync throughout. No API changes from 6.6.0. Upgrade guide: https://github.com/andrewBezerra/xunit-assured-net/blob/main/UPGRADING.md",
